    "message": "Update google-ads-api-quickstart skill for current APIs, flags, and documentation\n\n- Use `google-ads-googleads` as the Ruby gem name in the language routing table.\n- Update the example Google Ads API version to v26 and the Java client library version to 48.0.0.\n- Pass a `SearchGoogleAdsStreamRequest` object to `searchStream()` in the PHP reference and initialize `SearchStreamHandler` with service and request in the Perl reference.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1022185056",
